{
  "description": "Mark Discord's webhook and interaction tokens sensitive. GuildIncomingWebhookResponse.token is the credential that lets anyone post as the webhook (GET/POST /webhooks/{id}/{token} need no other auth), and the `webhook_token` / `interaction_token` path members are the same credential on the way in (an interaction token authorizes the callback and followups for 15 minutes). Sensitive members come back `Redacted` and are accepted as `string | Redacted<string>`.",
